<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, May 13 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are:</p>
<p>copper up 525, tin up 180, lead down 600, zinc down 2400, aluminium down 3150, nickel up 132, aluminium alloy down 440</p>
</text>
